        "date": "2026-10-21T15:33:22Z"
      },
      "message": "Skip the free-slot suspension while a Session waits for its sandbox (#811)\n\nA placement counts as active before its sandbox exists, so a node looked\nfull right after a Session was placed on it. The node lane then ran a\nfree-slot suspension and created the placed Session's sandbox only after it.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "8265edabe8040aaca04d403ece706f3edd5b7a7d",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/git/trees/8265edabe8040aaca04d403ece706f3edd5b7a7d"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/git/commits/d893afb85247995ca057467c0f7c2832e9ae2f85",
      "comment_count": 0,
