        "payload": "tree 6c402ff59efb54efd10efbd7cfe3cb107ec2fa86\nparent e6519f3500863627ffd4b56a0bc767695cc6b146\nauthor SaladDay <1203511142@qq.com> 1792590625 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792590625 +0800\n\nKeep a free slot on full nodes (#810)\n\n* Keep a free slot on full nodes\n\n* Give the free-slot inactivity its own limits row\n\n* Keep a free slot only where a Session can use it\n\nThe freed active slot admits no Session when the node's retained slots are\nfull, so the free-slot rule now also needs a free retained slot. SetCompute\nloads the suspension demand once for both checks.",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T13:50:25Z"
      }
