  {
    "sha": "e6519f3500863627ffd4b56a0bc767695cc6b146",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOUjI7ptoAKGU2NTE5ZjM1MDA4NjM2MjdmZmQ0YjU2YTBiYzc2NzY5NWNjNmIxNDY",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "SaladDay",
        "email": "1203511142@qq.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T13:50:04Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T13:50:04Z"
      },
      "message": "Wake placement as soon as capacity or preparation is ready (#809)\n\n* Wake placement as soon as capacity or preparation is ready\n\n* Hint only existing node lanes on capacity-blocked placement\n\n* Hint node lanes only for full nodes and skip direct lanes\n\nPlacement now hints the lanes only when it failed for capacity, so a\ngeneration rollout or reset does not double every lane's scans. A direct\nlane frees no node slot, and the freed-slot wake is a plain channel send.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "347895f64b8b26cd891adcecd578eac99b7bc75b",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/git/trees/347895f64b8b26cd891adcecd578eac99b7bc75b"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/git/commits/e6519f3500863627ffd4b56a0bc767695cc6b146",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
