  {
    "sha": "77927d9fe19f989f44d219f55eafc76cd4c740a6",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOUjI7ptoAKDc3OTI3ZDlmZTE5Zjk4OWY0NGQyMTlmNTVlYWZjNzZjZDRjNzQwYTY",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "SaladDay",
        "email": "1203511142@qq.com",
        "date": "2026-10-20T16:46:03Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-20T16:46:03Z"
      },
      "message": "Download only the selected Harness for self-hosted machines (#804)\n\n* Download only the selected Harness for self-hosted machines\n\nA self-hosted machine downloaded one 300 MB archive per platform holding\nNode and every Harness, again for every Session. The release now splits each\nplatform into a small base archive (oac-daemon, bundle.json) and one archive\nper component. The bootstrap fetches the base and starts oac-daemon install,\nwhich downloads Node and the selected Harnesses after onboarding, resumes\nafter resets, and keeps verified archives in native-download keyed by\nversion for later Sessions. Core serves the archives as a generic catalog and\nknows nothing of Harnesses.\n\n* Download before claiming and bound stalled native requests",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "3484c108578a4b1c148df089eb90e54641d62600",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/git/trees/3484c108578a4b1c148df089eb90e54641d62600"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/git/commits/77927d9fe19f989f44d219f55eafc76cd4c740a6",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq15rLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVdwQAK0bjNoYeMDCh06J3GK571IF\n8LlYSO7VHxY2LxNunsOYzwKeU2yJL+2nIGG5udVHYyeKWIMvqghGMNtpVDlmCSzT\nJ332WDUwRB3ldzlqMyDCpKSa0f05e8Ru5qzGL2/vETYTUDBNQJTUcNT8EPh52hIY\nqrdrc19J1CzolkNuvXtprbNYtlRRGIVjzgSrJFo9bkmlMR6FQPZyR24UZh7ikzBX\n7axtJUbbNgcWFGu3bzxUNIaOUgxGhx9znzAPmuvhvEkHBHVrFj9udrKdR29Cltn7\nbGv0EpaBgz0VRkBBroJc0ti2qsBoN8o3SVd1QuDktRUTA6XXyBog/07ecTeV5kGc\nf1GKblh9naJjBUVo4KOubwVfO0SE8bO5Hml8/MLdiq35IyOcJa7E04KKn9cLAWtM\nzkNFD+Ml1OXCVUaY2Jf7or3ZbFTq/hGfNzHqyACtOypuU5jkMuPsSY4Lxn35gqsT\nsOhnpRYWN5R2mKk/6D6bdACDWRZ7UK7HHmBb2BWgLjuI1Vn6R/KMklGGRjeqdvNo\nL00mP8N5Sh4i9GG+gqFydc6RYdVMa3M8J5JltU4Zupgd5yKilmZ4ODgLgnoue2Ws\ns7cW7LeuOFdF1dPd+Y+x1ggmvtkJeO68YLCeY1tSjIHvNp/07aBgsTZ6xHovSj5h\nkd+eHzN6v5M3bdiWRyeB\n=jEdN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 3484c108578a4b1c148df089eb90e54641d62600\nparent 938c12763f57625cf82cebd6b615751835ed772e\nauthor SaladDay <1203511142@qq.com> 1792514763 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792514763 +0800\n\nDownload only the selected Harness for self-hosted machines (#804)\n\n* Download only the selected Harness for self-hosted machines\n\nA self-hosted machine downloaded one 300 MB archive per platform holding\nNode and every Harness, again for every Session. The release now splits each\nplatform into a small base archive (oac-daemon, bundle.json) and one archive\nper component. The bootstrap fetches the base and starts oac-daemon install,\nwhich downloads Node and the selected Harnesses after onboarding, resumes\nafter resets, and keeps verified archives in native-download keyed by\nversion for later Sessions. Core serves the archives as a generic catalog and\nknows nothing of Harnesses.\n\n* Download before claiming and bound stalled native requests",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-20T16:46:03Z"
      }
    },
